<p style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em;">CAUTION: This email origi=
nated from outside your organization. Exercise caution when opening attachm=
ents or clicking links, especially from unknown senders.</p>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr;">Re: 1621 Clermont Rd, Durham NC, 27713 - PIN=
 0728808242 / REID 153775 (9.4 acres).<br>
<br>
Hello,<br>
I'm doing due diligence on a possible purchase. Durham Planning referred me=
 to you for the questions below. A quick reply, even partial, would help me=
 a lot.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr;"><br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"direction: ltr;">1. Given the former=
-landfill use, what soil/compaction or geotechnical testing would you requi=
re before a building permit?
<span style=3D"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">This question needs to =
be directed to planning at Planning@DurhamNC.gov</span></div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"direction: ltr;">2. What foundation =
or methane-mitigation conditions typically apply on a closed landfill?
<span style=3D"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">The chief building insp=
ector is copied to assist with this question.</span><br>
3. What impact fees would apply (Parks Zone 1, Open Space 1C, Streets Zone&=
nbsp;4), and are there liens on the property?
<span style=3D"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">The tax office would ad=
vise of liens.&nbsp; We do not have this information.&nbsp; For impact fees=
, you can find them at:&nbsp;
</span><span style=3D"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, =
0);"><a href=3D"https://www.durhamnc.gov/DocumentCenter/View/1007/City-Impa=
ct-Fee-Ordinance-PDF">https://www.durhamnc.gov/DocumentCenter/View/1007/Cit=
y-Impact-Fee-Ordinance-PDF</a></span><br>
4. Would you require NCDEQ Solid Waste sign-off before issuing a permit her=
e? <span style=3D"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"=
>
The chief building inspector is copied to assist with advising who can answ=
er this question.</span><br>
<br>
Thanks,<br>
Kalin Ivanov</div>
